        <title type="html"><![CDATA[霧燈開關的面版燈]]></title>
        <id>https://ttom921.github.io/my-blog/修理/tierra/霧燈開關的面版燈</id>
        <link href="https://ttom921.github.io/my-blog/修理/tierra/霧燈開關的面版燈"/>
        <updated>2026-08-31T10:57:58.000Z</updated>
        <summary type="html"><![CDATA[來記錄一些有關Ford tierra修理]]></summary>
        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<p>來記錄一些有關Ford tierra修理</p>
<p>車型:2004年tierra 1.6 aero 4D/A<br>
<!-- -->發照:2005年1月</p>
<p>零件12V 3mm的毛燈泡
所需工具：小支一字起子、斜口鉗<br>
<img decoding="async" loading="lazy" src="https://ttom921.github.io/my-blog/assets/images/mobile01-2d5f3831f731309aececf5b83a6b3354-e10cbfeb347aa8134b8cb317c94afb6d.jpg" width="640" height="480" class="img_ev3q"></p>
<p>行李廂、霧燈開關，裡面是有燈泡的
<img decoding="async" loading="lazy" src="https://ttom921.github.io/my-blog/assets/images/mobile01-07b952f2a698220a1102b532a0c50952-41f3db191298ff40ac1ae62fdf93ac71.jpg" width="640" height="853" class="img_ev3q"></p>
<p>之前還笨笨的從正面挖…看過某blog…從這才對
<img decoding="async" loading="lazy" src="https://ttom921.github.io/my-blog/assets/images/mobile01-40d29277cc2d1729992ef66229983d41-f0f278d915a2a9735b9e52b5d0f8e150.jpg" width="640" height="480" class="img_ev3q"></p>
<p><img decoding="async" loading="lazy" src="https://ttom921.github.io/my-blog/assets/images/mobile01-c35160b1e0614feb1824975225256988-40a59407ee6f0a724bc7bcd79edaa9f9.jpg" width="640" height="480" class="img_ev3q"></p>
<p>上兩張照片的板子拿下，手伸進去從背後推出來
<img decoding="async" loading="lazy" src="https://ttom921.github.io/my-blog/assets/images/mobile01-ee83aa37ba2bd1fa54f2ca157b6919d5-32b12de72ed9a7daa5fb859a47db898a.jpg" width="640" height="480" class="img_ev3q"></p>
<p>接頭拆開，按鈕總成就下來了
<img decoding="async" loading="lazy" src="https://ttom921.github.io/my-blog/assets/images/mobile01-f8a24a7f17625a78a7adc2240f7bb511-4700aa73d648bdef2878005cf775e5ee.jpg" width="640" height="480" class="img_ev3q"></p>
<p>第一次拆下有點嚇一跳…比T牌用的還小
<img decoding="async" loading="lazy" src="https://ttom921.github.io/my-blog/assets/images/mobile01-64cab61d1d5a590e386598d8ecd25c35-3a2eba11b3e748ab087ff76a70381f70.jpg" width="640" height="853" class="img_ev3q"></p>
<p>左邊是這台車的3mm / 右邊是T牌用的5mm
<img decoding="async" loading="lazy" src="https://ttom921.github.io/my-blog/assets/images/mobile01-32148294b7ed86c17520062927991f15-c74eff06f37676db475d23392a555684.jpg" width="640" height="853" class="img_ev3q"></p>
<p>汽材行其實買的到含座的燈泡，我在鄉下的汽材行買一顆竟然要價$100，比我的H4還貴
換毛燈泡很簡單，它只是一顆小燈泡穿過塑膠座，再繞過溝槽
<img decoding="async" loading="lazy" src="https://ttom921.github.io/my-blog/assets/images/mobile01-a32ab461e99e027568b4c664ee795aa2-fb5c7e1ba42b483a88627efc77c4d2f7.jpg" width="640" height="480" class="img_ev3q"></p>
<p>新的燈泡，腳穿過去，繞過後多出來的要剪掉
<img decoding="async" loading="lazy" src="https://ttom921.github.io/my-blog/assets/images/mobile01-876875dfe7bcfe0c2fcd91a9aca9b32b-26a2017564edfe83d61066969937daf0.jpg" width="640" height="480" class="img_ev3q"></p>
<p>裝回去<br>
<img decoding="async" loading="lazy" src="https://ttom921.github.io/my-blog/assets/images/mobile01-243b3f14bace6f31593c22f36d1abb6e-d81eb03b0661a14741b49209ab0889ee.jpg" width="640" height="480" class="img_ev3q"></p>]]></content>
